The design comes from que (https://github.com/queapp-org/que), by the same
author, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0: the quiet board, the
logged unlock, quiet now, the apply-tonight guardrail (que's effectiveConfig),
the overnight summary, the chip's countdown and the settings dialog's layout.
mods/quiet-hours/unlock.svg is que's open-lock icon
(src/renderer/src/components/icons.tsx).

The sidebar-width check in mods/quiet-hours/main.js (find, narrow) is adapted
from the workspace-chrome mod shipped with the Herdr app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0; modified. The chip draws the Herdr app's own
mods/workspace-chrome/clock.svg from the person's install; it is not copied
here.
